[en.FOCUS_C12_DUST_SETTLES]
Dust Settles

[en.FOCUS_C12_DUST_SETTLES_desc]
Limestone Pie achieved the long-awaited victory she had dreamed of; her flag was planted all over Cantlot, and her generals marched with heads held high in parades throughout every occupied territory. Even the Resistance Alliance, who had fought alongside her, began to tremble before her authority. All the ponies started to wonder what the future held. The smoke of war gradually dissipated, yet the wind demons that had loomed over all of Equestria did not vanish—they continued to roar in the hearts of every pony...

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DUST_SETTLES]
尘埃落地

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DUST_SETTLES_desc]
石青派获得了她梦寐以求的胜利，她的旗帜插满了整个坎特洛特，她的将军们昂首挺胸的在各个占领区举行阅兵，即便是并肩作战的抵抗同盟军也开始畏惧于她的威严。所有小马都开始思考未来会怎么办，战争的硝烟渐渐散去，但是笼罩在整个小马利亚上空的风之魔并没有就此消失，它们正在所有小马的内心中嘶吼着...

